<title>ITALY: Tennis - Milan indoor first round results.</title>
<headline>Tennis - Milan indoor first round results.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN, Italy 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $815,000 Milan indoor tennis tournament on Monday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) beat Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) 6-3 7-6 (8-6)</p>
<p>Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Carlos Costa (Spain) 4-6 6-3 6-2 </p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Cristiano Caratti (Italy) 6-4 6-2 </p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Alex Corretja (Spain) 7-5 6-0</p>
<p>Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) beat Guy Forget (France) 6-1  6-4</p>
<p>Sergi Bruguera (Spain) beat 2-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) 4-6 7-6 (7-3) 7-6 (15-13).</p>
</text>
